From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 22:10:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1325/3799] soh: rename func_80983FEC ->
 DemoIk_Type2SetupAppear

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the type 2 cue-5 handler: snaps to cue 4's start position and switches to action mode 4 with the animation rewound.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_Ik/z_demo_ik.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_Ik/z_demo_ik.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_Ik/z_demo_ik.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_Ik/z_demo_ik.c
index a3d65f73e..4b0f96906 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_Ik/z_demo_ik.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_Ik/z_demo_ik.c
@@ -348,7 +348,8 @@ void DemoIk_Type2SetupHidden(DemoIk* this) {
     this->drawMode = 0;
 }
 
-void func_80983FEC(DemoIk* this, PlayState* play) {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80983FEC: the type 2 cue-5 handler: snaps to cue 4's start position and switches to action mode 4 with the animation rewound.
+void DemoIk_Type2SetupAppear(DemoIk* this, PlayState* play) {
     DemoIk_MoveToStartPos(this, play, 4);
     this->actionMode = 4;
     this->drawMode = 2;
@@ -374,7 +375,7 @@ void func_80984048(DemoIk* this, PlayState* play) {
                     DemoIk_Type2SetupHidden(this);  // was func_80983FDC [LLM:HIGH]
                     break;
                 case 5:
-                    func_80983FEC(this, play);
+                    DemoIk_Type2SetupAppear(this, play);  // was func_80983FEC [LLM:HIGH]
                     break;
                 case 6:
                     func_8098402C(this);
